WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.070 --> 00:00:05.590
In Egypt, a Hebrew mother hides her
baby boy in a basket among the reeds.

2
00:00:05.640 --> 00:00:07.700
Pharaoh's daughter finds him.

3
00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:12.590
She calls him Moses: because
I drew him out of the water.

4
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:17.930
Years later, in the desert, a bush
burns with fire but is not consumed.

5
00:00:17.980 --> 00:00:22.070
And Moses asks: who am
I, to go to Pharaoh?

6
00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:26.840
So what did God give the people
through the man Jews call our teacher?

7
00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:31.480
In this mission, you'll follow Moses from
the river to a mountain in the desert.

8
00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:36.130
Then you'll compare how Orthodox
and Reform Jews see that gift today.

9
00:00:36.180 --> 00:00:40.360
Your mission: find out what God
gave the people through Moses.
